  "description": "Operating Area: Bahamas, Florida East Coast, Florida Keys\n\nSpend a thrilling day or more, cruising the sparkling waters of South Florida, the Bahamas, and the surrounding areas on a beautiful, pristine 70 ft. Azimut Flybridge. Lupo II is a pristine 70 ft Azimut Flybridge fitted to accommodate up to 13 guests for an unforgettable experience. With a convertible pull out bed and a twin bedroom that can be modified into an additional King, the Lupo II can sleep up to 10 guests and is perfectly suited for term rentals and day cruises with family and friends.",
